---
// Cover page: a simple holding version while the site is being built.
// Copy comes from the approved mockup (design/approved-mockup.html).
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="AI-Assisted Multi-Agent Application Development · Case study">
  <header class="mx-auto flex h-21 max-w-[1200px] items-center justify-between px-4 md:px-10">
    <a href="/" class="flex flex-col leading-tight text-graphite no-underline">
      <span class="font-display text-[18px] tracking-[-0.02em]">Millie Chan</span>
      <span class="text-[12px] text-steel">Product designer</span>
    </a>
    <span class="hidden font-display text-[13px] text-steel sm:block">Case study · AI for fund compliance</span>
  </header>

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 pt-10 pb-20 md:px-10">
    <p class="font-display text-[13px] text-brass">
      Case study <span class="font-mono">[2026]</span> · Work in progress · All data is fictional
    </p>

    <h1 class="mt-7 max-w-[13em] text-[clamp(38px,4.5vw,56px)] leading-[0.98]">
      AI agents draft a fund’s reporting calendar. A human specialist approves every rule.
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-7 max-w-[32em] text-subheading leading-[1.45] text-steel">
      Investment funds must send regular reports to government regulators, each by a deadline set in
      law. My tool uses AI to read those laws and draft the deadlines, quoting the exact sentence each
      one comes from. A human compliance specialist checks and approves the work at three points, and
      plain code works out the final dates.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a
        href="/system"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-graphite bg-graphite px-5 py-3 font-display text-[16px] tracking-[-0.02em] text-white transition-colors hover:bg-black"
      >
        See the design system <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-15 max-w-[40em] rounded-asym bg-ivory p-6 text-caption text-steel">
      The full case study is being built. Chapters are added at the end of each phase of the project.
    </p>
  </main>
</Base>
